+id: task-003-validate-task-input
+type: task
+title: "Validate task input"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Reject task input when adding, renaming or tagging if a title is blank after trimming, exceeds 120
+characters, a priority is not `low`, `normal` or `high`, or a tag is blank or contains whitespace.
+Return a clear error and leave the task list unchanged on rejection.
